{
  "id": 357768085,
  "iid": 18851,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: fix for Null pointer dereferences  (FORWARD_NULL) in removeMenusandSubmenus",
  "description": "This issue is originated from !18644.\n\nAn earlier Coverity issue (`CID 1617511`) was not properly handled and it resurfaced after the !18644 merge request was approved.\n\nThe solution is to add a check on `cur_menu`. It was tested with Coverity and the original reported issue is solved with this patch.\n\n```c\n    // Remove empty submenus.\n    while (cur_menu != parent_menu) {\n        if (!cur_menu)\n            break;\n        QMenu *empty_menu = (cur_menu->isEmpty() ? cur_menu : NULL);\n        cur_menu = dynamic_cast<QMenu *>(cur_menu->parent());\n        delete empty_menu;\n    }\n```",
  "state": "merged",
